From 9510fa770429804289e18adca5bba6655a93ac26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timur Ravilov <93673987+t0b1kent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 09:59:33 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 44/46] EXPERIMENT: guarded binary32/64 subnormal loads and
 retired x87 counters (default off)

Family: FLD m32/m64 binary-to-full80 conversions.
Members: D9 /0 and DD /0; normal and signed zero existing; subnormal added.
Trigger: recorded FLD entries; integer normalization avoids host DAZ/FZ.
Coverage: full converter/JIT; FCW-independent exact load; NaNs/infinities use FEX fallback.
Regression: native functional 4144; base0 OFF/ON 896, differences 0; subnormal siblings/edges.
Diagnostics: explicit gate, normal-exit stderr, owned mapped counters, no debugger.
Audit completed: yes. No install; candidate game acceptance pending.
